# Adept of Taste (Q330) with plain honey: a level 24 character already holding most of each count
# accepts at Jonas. Sonia hands out her book and asks for more while one white root is short; her
# red mandragora sap offer (on a page she never shows) is refused as a bypass the dialog did not
# offer. A wild sprout past both chances (roll 99), a sapling's white root (roll 90) and a blossom's
# red root past its count make it forty of each, and Sonia gives the white sap. Jacob makes plain
# honey from the twenty nectars when the player takes his offer, Pano trades the potato, Glyvka's
# green moss bundle offer is refused the same way as Sonia's until a giant crimson ant's brown moss
# (roll 9) gives the brown bundle, and Rollant cuts the meat. With two special ingredients and the
# even roll pinned to false, Jonas cooks the third steak dish, Mirien reviews it, and Jonas pays for
# the review with the salad recipe as the repeatable quest ends; then relog. Expectations replay the
# reference trace of this scenario.
